**3. First on Stealth Bench V2 (selected sites).**

- Stealth Bench V2 (September 25, 2026), 100 sites that block bots, 2 visits per provider: Browser Use Cloud got through 90.5% of the time, Anchor 82%, Kernel 80.5%, Browserbase 78.5%, Browserless 77.5%, Steel 74.5%, Hyperbrowser 73.5%; plain headless Chrome 3%. The sites were picked where Browser Use Cloud historically got through and stock Chrome did not, so they are not a balanced sample of the web. [Results, method and code](https://browser-use.com/benchmarks/browsers)
- Online-Mind2Web, all 300 live tasks across 136 websites: Browser Use Cloud V4 98% with our own agentic judge; the best human-graded results on the official leaderboard are 97.7% and 97.3%. Different judges, so not one ranking. [Results and judges](https://browser-use.com/best-web-agents.md) · [Official leaderboard](https://huggingface.co/spaces/osunlp/Online_Mind2Web_Leaderboard)
