- [Shopping and checkout](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/shopping.md): unit-price comparison, stock checks, coupons, carts
- [Travel and booking](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/travel.md): flights, hotels, restaurant tables, seat maps
- [Testing and QA](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/testing.md): live UI testing, parallel page QA, console errors
- [Research](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/research.md): regulators, clinical registries, academic publishers, public records
- [Companies and jobs](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/companies.md): directories, portfolios, exhibitor lists, job boards
