- [Agent workflows](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/workflows.md): parallel, scheduled, long-running, logged-in, reusable skills
- [Games and real-time](https://browser-use.com/showcase/category/games.md): chess, Tetris, GeoGuessr, real-time browser games

